                                "sense_id": "bd6b8624-967b-3200-8121-b4b552829b30",
                                "text": "De reddingswerkers zochten dagenlang naar overlevenden na de aardbeving.",
                                "translation": "The rescue workers searched for survivors for days after the earthquake.",
                                "english": "The rescue workers searched for survivors for days after the earthquake."
